SolarisPKN-Verity in Debian
==========================

This distribution installs only userspace experimental tools and an
optional Linux AF_ALG Merkle formatter. It does NOT install the Yocto
BLAKE3 kernel provider, register AF_ALG algorithms, patch dm-verity,
enable Secure Boot, alter disks, or mount block devices.

Use a trusted root hash and independently verified boot chain when
building any dm-verity-based solution. Do not treat the CLI output as
evidence of a secure boot or a production integrity guarantee.
